NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the source code only.

The connectome files committed under data/ are derived from published datasets
with their own terms:

  - data/circuit.npz and data/thresholds/*.npz derive from the Janelia FlyEM
    male-CNS v1.0 dataset, licensed CC-BY 4.0.

  - data/circuit-flywire.npz derives from the FlyWire FAFB v783 public release,
    licensed CC-BY-NC 4.0. Commercial use of that file, and of any result
    derived from it, is NOT permitted by its source licence.

Results under results/ that involve the female animal inherit the same
non-commercial condition.
